    "It’s no secret that the credit-support side of this model will help to address a financing gap that Nvidia itself has identified.",
    "In an 8-K filing dated June 12th, Sharon AI disclosed that the agreement runs for six years and covers 72 MW of new Australian data center capacity built to Nvidia's DSX AI factory design, scaling to as many as 40,000 Grace Blackwell GB300 GPUs.",
