  "article": "Nvidia Corp. (NVDA) Announces a Profit-Sharing Program For Its Computing Framework Access",
  "gold_statement": "On July 1, Nvidia Corp. (NASDAQ:NVDA) disclosed a profit-sharing program developed to give model builders, AI startups, and businesses access to Nvidia's computing framework, without the need for these entities to fund hardware buildouts.",
  "gold_meaning": {
   "who": "NVIDIA",
   "what": "programme taking a usage-based share of AI clouds' revenue on capacity NVIDIA supports, on top of product revenue",
   "how_much": "share not disclosed",
   "period": "disclosed July 1, 2026",
   "status": "happened"
  },
  "draws": {
   "A1": [
    "On July 1, Nvidia Corp. (NASDAQ:NVDA) disclosed a profit-sharing program developed to give model builders, AI startups, and businesses access to Nvidia's computing framework, without the need for these entities to fund hardware buildouts. Under this arrangement, NVIDIA, in addition to product revenue, will receive a share of cloud revenue based on the capacity it supports, as AI cloud providers deliver NVIDIA-powered solutions to their end users.",
    "Nvidia said that this plan highlights a transition in AI demand from model building towards production inference tasks, needing continuous running of infrastructure at scale."
   ],
