A1,A2,A3,B3 Firmus Technologies, a private company, is constructing a campus in Batam, Indonesia, built to Nvidia's DGX SuperPOD (DSX) reference architecture specifications. The facility is expected to scale to 360MW and house up to 170,000 Nvidia GPUs [1] [3] .
